	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/israeli-food-tech-company-helps-alleviate-health-concerns-related-to-commercial-frying/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Israeli Food-tech Company Helps Alleviate Health Concerns Related To Commercial Frying" decoding="async" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header-300x166.jpg 300w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header-1024x568.jpg 1024w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header-768x426.jpg 768w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header.jpg 1038w" sizes="(max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="9520" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/israeli-food-tech-company-helps-alleviate-health-concerns-related-to-commercial-frying/beyond-oil-blog-header/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Beyond-Oil-Blog-Header.jpg" data-orig-size="1038,576" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="Beyond Oil &amp;#8211; Blog Header" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;Blog Header Beyond Oil&lt;/p&gt;
